WEBVTT

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:04.470
Don't pursue this any further, Yuliy!

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:16.230
<i>-Where is he?</i>
<i>-The current is fast. We need light!</i>

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:25.450
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.500
Father, he's up.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:32.700
Father!

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:23.730
All done now.

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:25.480
Thank you.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:30.160
However, considering the circumstances
I found you in, I called the police.

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:32.950
Don't take it the wrong way.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:34.030
Okay.

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:37.620
But you sure are tough.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:40.250
And you ate so much!

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.710
You slept through two whole days.

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:45.840
I'm Kisuke Hanada.

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.010
Are you a doctor?

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:51.800
Well, something like that.
This is my daughter, Saki.

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:54.050
Nice to meet you.

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:56.470
I'm Yuliy.

00:02:57.060 --> 00:02:59.350
Yuliy? A foreigner?

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:02.060
-Yes, I am.
-Really? Why can you speak Japanese?

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:05.940
Why aren't your eyes black?
Hey, why is your hair white?

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:10.320
Saki, don't give him a hard time.

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:13.450
-Take those dishes back, will you?
-Okay!

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:17.370
All right then, I'll get back to work.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:23.040
Excuse me.

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:25.960
Master, you have a visitor.

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:31.630
She's suspicious of us.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:34.140
Maybe it's because
your face is scary, Fallon.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:35.470
Me?

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:40.390
I told you not to pursue her.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:42.770
I couldn't stop it.

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:45.610
I felt a sensation
like the blood of a beast

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:46.980
was flowing inside me.

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:52.280
A beast wouldn't take
the bond of his pack lightly.

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:54.160
Especially a wolf.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.320
I had a dream about...

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.120
About that time...

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:01.660
If I hadn't obeyed
the blood of the beast then,

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:03.790
I wouldn't have been rescued by you...

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:05.540
and I would be dead.

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:08.250
That's right.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:11.800
It is true that you are supported
by the blood of the beast.

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:15.390
However, you must never drown
in the power of the blood.

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:19.390
The moment you drown in it,
you will no longer be a Jaeger.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:22.060
Yes.

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:25.770
I spoke with the master of this house.

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:28.110
He said you can stay here until you heal.

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:30.900
I'm fine.
If I just wrap the bandages tightly--

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.360
You should take him up on the offer.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:36.200
I'll leave Philip just in case.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:42.120
-What? Why me? Fallon can stay.
-Well, I would scare that little girl.

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:46.580
-Counting on you!
-Hey, stop. Don't touch my hair!

00:04:57.680 --> 00:05:00.890
DIVINE PUNISHMENT

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.770
-Police.
-Freeze!

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:29.710
Yuliy.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:32.250
-Can't sleep?
-Right.

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:36.090
Your father?

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:37.760
Working...

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:39.640
I can't bother him.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:41.430
Your mother?

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:43.220
Up in the sky.

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:49.270
All right. I'll read you a book
until you feel sleepy.

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:53.320
Thank you, Brother Yuliy.

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:55.990
Brother, huh?

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:58.110
CHILDREN'S LITERATURE

00:05:58.200 --> 00:05:59.740
Was your mother sick?

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:01.200
Yeah.

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:05.500
Father was crying,
saying that even though he was a doctor,

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:06.870
he couldn't cure her.

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:14.590
Your father works this late at night?

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:17.170
Yeah. He says he's making
something amazing

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:19.220
-so he can't sleep.
-Something amazing?

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:22.390
He says it's something
Mother would be happy about too.

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:26.100
-I see. Let's hope he finishes it soon.
-Yeah.

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:29.310
<i>What's the situation?</i>

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:33.770
The culprits broke into the home of
biologist Yoshio Abe and murdered him.

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:36.070
They fought with the police at the scene,

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:38.400
-and there were casualties.
-The Hyakko Party?

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:42.120
Yes. They hide their faces
with strange masks when committing crimes.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:44.120
They kill war profiteers, the wealthy,

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:47.290
scholars backed by the government,
researchers, one after another.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.080
The ringleader, Naotora Momose,

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:51.330
calls himself the last
anti-government samurai,

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:54.920
fights for the return of feudalism
and the revision of equality for all--

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.000
A "terrorist."

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:58.010
A what?

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:00.260
That's what they call such people
in France.

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:03.220
They act in large groups,
yet are never caught.

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:06.640
They must be backed by
a very powerful organization.

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:09.600
And that organization
finances the Hyakko Party?

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:12.730
I'm guessing it's a
foreign secret intelligence organization.

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:17.280
But they demand
the exclusion of foreigners.

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:20.990
It's not uncommon for someone to say
the opposite of what they really think.

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:23.110
V Shipping, you think?

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:24.820
They're responsible

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:27.580
for the urban warfare-like scuffle
the other day.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.500
We'll have to see.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:33.420
We must not lose sight
of what the focal point of this chaos is.

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:34.750
With that said...

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:38.170
It is our job to make sure
people like them don't walk around

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:40.510
<i>triumphantly in this Imperial City.</i>

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:45.850
Welcome.

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:49.180
Mockingbird, with lemon, not lime.

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:55.110
-Unfortunately, we're out of lemon.
-Surely you've got one in the back, no?

00:07:57.440 --> 00:08:00.900
I never thought
I'd ever actually use this password.

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:04.490
Alma Trading Company...

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:07.450
-Do you know it?
-They're business rivals.

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:09.540
For the front, that is.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:13.710
Recently, they've begun trading
with this country's military as well.

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:17.210
They buy and sell weapons
and even fund weapons development.

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:19.090
That's way too conspicuous.

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:22.800
Do you think Kershner
and his gang are involved in this?

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:26.300
I would think
that cunning bunch would do it better...

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:29.220
I'll continue gathering information.

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:37.940
Brother Yuliy is feeling better!

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:40.070
That guy's body isn't normal.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:42.610
It's because Master treated him.

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:45.780
He's always been a great surgeon.

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:48.700
-He specializes in cardiology.
-Oh, yeah?

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:53.370
So when his wife died from heart disease,
it must have been unbearable.

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:57.420
He closed his hospital and is developing
a piece of medical equipment.

00:08:58.420 --> 00:08:59.420
On his own?

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:03.760
Actually, he had an assistant,
but he's been missing since the other day.

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:07.930
Oh, I'm sorry. I'm such a chatterbox.

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:10.510
Please make yourself at home.

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:15.980
They sure are getting along well.

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:18.860
You're going to need poles.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:22.070
-Let me set them up?
-Sure!

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:26.070
I'm glad. Mother said that
we should grow tomatoes.

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:28.240
Since Father is busy with work,

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:30.700
she thought we should grow
something nutritious.

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:32.490
Your mother was kind.

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:36.330
Is your mother kind too, Brother Yuliy?

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:38.830
She was kind.

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:41.250
But she's not here anymore.

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:44.760
Is she up in the sky?

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:49.550
Then they must be pals up in the sky,
just like we are.

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:50.890
Yeah.

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:54.140
I bet the two of them
are watching over us.

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:58.270
And they will speak to our hearts.

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:00.770
-Our hearts?
-Yeah.

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:05.150
They'll say, "You can do it."

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:11.120
<i>You just cannot...</i>

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:13.280
<i>ignore the words of the dead.</i>

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:21.380
Father. Yuliy has been injured?

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:23.710
Ryoko, you should at least knock.

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.590
I'm-- I'm truly sorry.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:27.720
His life is not in danger.

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:29.260
Please don't worry.

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:30.930
I'm glad.

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:35.680
-I'd like to visit Yuliy--
-Thank you for your concern.

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:38.810
However,
he will be back in just a few days.

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:40.810
-But--
-Ryoko...

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:43.860
acting imprudently
will cause trouble for others.

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:45.110
Restrain yourself.

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:54.870
Thank you.

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.660
It seems your mind is elsewhere.

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:05.130
Sensei, please let me have another match.

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.340
That's no problem.

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:09.380
If I win,

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:11.760
I'd like to ask you for just one favor.

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:16.430
I'd be happy to help you, miss.

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:19.810
Then if I win,
please tell me where Yuliy is staying.

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:23.230
-Miss?
-Please!

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:29.940
It seems as though you've already won...

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:34.070
<i>I wonder if the Hyakko Party are ninjas.</i>

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:37.120
Masks and black clothes, right?

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:39.540
Plus they write on walls with blood!

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:41.870
I bet it's a spell ninjas use.

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:43.370
"Tenchu"...

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:46.500
It means something like
"divine punishment."

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:48.500
But I'm not convinced.

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:51.510
Last night's victim
was a biologist, right?

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:53.890
Divine punishment for a scholar...

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:55.680
That is strange indeed.

00:11:56.260 --> 00:11:58.640
We need to investigate any similar cases,

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:01.180
not just in Japan,
but in other countries as well.

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:04.060
Do you think the Vampires are involved?

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:08.480
When someone tries to hide something,
there will be a tell in their actions.

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:12.820
I can't help but feel the Hyakko Party
and the Vampires are somehow connected.

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:18.120
-The Royals that appeared the other day...
-They left some traces too.

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:22.410
Kershner probably won't keep quiet either.

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:28.170
A Sirius survivor...

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:32.800
What a terrible blunder you made
against a mere beast, Agatha.

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:35.300
You look pathetic now,

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:38.510
but if you still have the pride
as a tribe member...

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:41.180
show it to me.

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:46.940
Doctor, it's time for dinner.

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:49.150
Doctor?

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:51.650
Maybe he's in the laboratory?

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:02.330
Almost there...

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:04.910
Almost there...

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:07.290
Saki...

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:22.930
Although they come in a month late,
we also have a line of foreign newspapers.

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:24.560
Thank you.

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:28.100
It's no problem.
Baron Naoe has been very good to us.

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:31.650
That'll be all, thank you. <i>Ciao!</i>

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:34.110
<i>I think Yuliy is ready to come back now.</i>

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:35.610
<i>Anything else to report?</i>

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:38.200
<i>Not especially...</i>

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:40.280
<i>-What is it?</i>
<i>-Well...</i>

00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:42.700
<i>I just happened to see his documents...</i>

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:45.830
<i>but this doctor's research</i>
<i>is quite something.</i>

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:48.790
<i>I think it was probably...</i>

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:52.460
An artificial heart?

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:01.510
Wow, I didn't know they were this big.

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:04.520
Tomatoes used be a decorative plant.

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:06.310
Really?

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:08.980
People thought
the red fruit was poisonous but--

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:10.610
Awfully talkative, aren't we?

00:14:10.690 --> 00:14:14.610
You sure do talk
when it comes to plants and flowers.

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:24.120
Philip, do you not like Brother Yuliy?

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:27.000
Well, it's not that I don't like him...

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:35.510
Yuliy had a friend...

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:39.010
and that friend did something awful
to my parents.

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:42.890
That gets on my nerves, I guess.

00:14:43.810 --> 00:14:46.270
Is Brother Yuliy also to blame for that?

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:49.480
If you put it that way,

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:51.730
maybe it's not his fault, but...

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:54.150
Then it's okay
to get along with him, right?

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:57.530
Oh, man.

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:06.490
-Want me to play it?
-Yeah! Let me hear it, Philip.

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:09.120
What? So, no "Brother" for me?

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:13.170
Now, a song for the princess.

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:15.340
Saki.

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:17.130
Father?

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:19.260
It's done.

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:24.640
-Oh, Father.
-It's finished.

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.430
It's completed, Saki!

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:29.980
-Your work, is it finished?
-Yeah.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:32.770
Will it make Mother happy?

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:36.070
Yeah! I'm sure she will be happy.

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:38.820
Father!

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:40.610
I'm sorry, Saki...

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.870
for being busy all the time.

00:15:44.530 --> 00:15:47.830
From now on, my time is yours.

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:55.710
Oh, really?

00:15:56.210 --> 00:15:57.210
At last...

00:15:58.250 --> 00:15:59.210
So...

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:02.510
About the money you promised...

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:13.350
I detest cowards like you.

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:15.900
You have no pride or loyalty.

00:16:16.110 --> 00:16:18.980
-You're an inferior and foolish human.
-Help me.

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:31.950
I investigated the researchers
killed by the Hyakko Party,

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:35.330
and found that some of their
research results have been stolen.

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:37.590
There were similar cases abroad.

00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:39.300
Just as you predicted.

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:42.970
A biologist
who researched artificial blood...

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:46.510
a University professor
who was researching iron lungs...

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:48.720
Artificial organs...

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:51.310
The cultivation of organs,

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:54.390
and the research and development
of alternative organs

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:56.190
is becoming popular in the West.

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:02.570
The owner of the car has been identified.

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:04.900
The car the Vampires were using?

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:07.700
<i>Yes. The number plate was found,</i>

00:17:07.910 --> 00:17:10.330
<i>and they say it's</i>
<i>Professor Hanada's private car.</i>

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:11.950
<i>It was reported stolen</i>

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:14.620
<i>when the professor's assistant</i>
<i>went missing.</i>

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:16.620
That connects the dots.

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:26.470
What the...?

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:29.430
You must be Mr. Willard from V Shipping?

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:32.100
Nice to meet you.

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:35.770
My name is Tada, a reporter for
the magazine <i>True Crime Records.</i>

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:38.190
Forgive me, we're in a hurry.

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.770
I won't trouble you.

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:43.650
I just want to talk to you
for a little bit.

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:49.160
She still isn't back from the store.

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:51.740
Let's just make dinner on our own.

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:54.910
-Can you cook, Philip?
-"Brother Philip", okay?

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:57.540
Fish in Japan is tasty, right?

00:17:57.920 --> 00:18:00.080
Then how about
I whip up some fish and chips...

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:02.500
What the...?

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:09.220
Yuliy...

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:10.760
Buy me 20 seconds!

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:26.400
Yuliy.

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:35.750
Royals?

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:38.410
Sorry, little miss.

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:40.960
We're going to take your daddy.

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:44.130
But only if my blood approves, that is!

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:45.420
No!

00:18:46.340 --> 00:18:47.380
Father!

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:55.970
-Father! Father!
-Get away, Saki!

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:58.810
No, Philip. Father will die!

00:19:00.770 --> 00:19:02.480
Yuliy! Damn it!

00:19:03.940 --> 00:19:05.780
Father?

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:15.740
I never imagined a Sirius survivor

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:18.830
would come chasing us
all the way here to the Far East.

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:20.080
I told you...

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:22.380
You all smell.

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:26.000
That's why, until you're wiped out,

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:28.880
I'll chase you,
and kill every last one of you!

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:39.310
Oh, wow, I got really lost.

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:43.350
Perhaps it would cause him trouble
to visit this late.

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:49.490
-No. Philip, let me go.
-It's too late.

00:19:56.370 --> 00:19:58.540
Oh, he looks wonderful!

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:10.670
Saki, run...

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:16.600
-Where are you looking?
-Saki!

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:19.010
You think you can beat me without looking?

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:23.020
Father...

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:29.360
-Saki.
-You Sirius scum!

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:32.150
Don't mess with me!

00:21:01.140 --> 00:21:02.560
You're filthy...

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:05.350
lower than a beast, Sirius.

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:10.730
And now you're drawn towards the Ark?

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:15.530
It's too late--

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:22.200
Ark?

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:24.660
Father. Father...

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:26.580
Father!

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:41.350
Yuliy!

00:22:14.920 --> 00:22:15.760
Yuliy.

00:22:21.050 --> 00:22:23.350
Big brother?

00:22:23.430 --> 00:22:24.930
EPISODE 2
DEPRIVED TALENT

00:24:02.990 --> 00:24:05.320
<i>-Glowing ash?</i>
<i>-Now, with the Ark of Sirius gone...</i>

00:24:05.410 --> 00:24:06.580
<i>My dear family.</i>

00:24:06.660 --> 00:24:08.700
<i>There may be a blood pact</i>
<i>with the Vampires.</i>

00:24:08.790 --> 00:24:10.540
<i>-Dogville...</i>
<i>-Our destined land.</i>

00:24:10.620 --> 00:24:12.040
EPISODE 3
INDELIBLE MEMORIES

00:24:21.670 --> 00:24:25.050
Subtitle translation by Haruna Saito
